IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID: REPORT-TEST.

*> 這份檢查器不需要修改，是這一題的驗收標準。

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  CK-V6     PIC S9(6).
01  CK-LABEL  PIC X(12).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
COBLINGS-TEST-MAIN.
    PERFORM LOAD-NUMS

    PERFORM MAKE-SUM
    MOVE WS-SUM TO CK-V6
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "MAKE-SUM：10+20+30+40"
              BY CONTENT 100
              BY CONTENT CK-V6

    PERFORM MAKE-DOUBLED
    MOVE WS-DOUBLED TO CK-V6
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "MAKE-DOUBLED：10*2 再 +7"
              BY CONTENT 27
              BY CONTENT CK-V6

    PERFORM MAKE-LABEL
    MOVE WS-LABEL TO CK-LABEL
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "MAKE-LABEL：範圍要剛好停在 SETUP-LABEL"
              BY CONTENT "REPORT-OK   "
              BY CONTENT CK-LABEL

*> 段落之間要有清楚的邊界：呼叫這段不應該影響到別段。
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-LABEL
    PERFORM MAKE-LABEL
    MOVE WS-LABEL TO CK-LABEL
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "MAKE-LABEL 可以重複執行且結果穩定"
              BY CONTENT "REPORT-OK   "
              BY CONTENT CK-LABEL

    CALL "COBLINGS-DONE"
    GOBACK.
